data: {"id": "750697b95825416c-thinking-parallel_evidence-471", "run_id": "750697b95825416c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n**实体身份**：`aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz`，UID `86b6a1bf-eb40-431d-bfb5-00fe85ed2475`，调度到 `node2`，Phase = **Pending**，Container `app` 状态 = **Waiting (ContainerCreating)**，从未重启过。\n\n**根因证据（确凿）**：\n- **Events**: kubelet 持续报 `Warning FailedMount`（45 分钟内累计 23 次）：\n  - `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n  - `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition`\n- **Pod Spec**: volume `in", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788771256276, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

